; --- Edge found by review, 2026-09-20: the runtime neighbour --------------------------------------
; ride-runtime.t27 names this file four times in its own prose and was named here in no constant
; at all. It is not a copy owner: no table crosses between the two. What crosses is a
; CLASSIFICATION of the same four failure boundaries of the live bridge -- module import, roster
; fetch, roster filtering and renderer start -- which this file answers as a player-visible
; ROSTER_OUTCOME and that file answers as a host EVENT with a reason code. The two are not the
; same answer, and the difference is exactly why the edge has to be written down: an empty
; filtered roster is ROSTER_OUTCOME_EMPTY here and EVENT_UNAVAILABLE with reason UNAVAILABLE_EMPTY
; there, so a reader who assumes the two enumerations agree value for value is wrong about that
; one boundary and right about the other three. The host event kinds and their reason codes are
; the runtime's, the player-visible outcome is this file's, and neither may be edited into
; agreement with the other alone.
